{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308310","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230831001:1":{"text":"이 항구에 갇힌 지 며칠이 지났는지 이미 세는 것도 잊었다고요!","source_cn":"我已经数不清自己被困在这座港口多少日子了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD07AA55EC07B2DA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230831002:1":{"text":"드디어 이곳을 떠나게 되다니, 비현실적인 느낌마저 들어요.","source_cn":"现在好不容易可以离开这里，我却突然感觉有些不真实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273501A32E9DD51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230831003:1":{"text":"갑자기 업타운에서 다시 항구를 봉쇄하겠다고 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"仿佛下一刻，上城区又会传出通知，告诉我港口再次封锁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8C46CED7F08024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230831004:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여! 제발 제가 무사히 러스트 항을 떠날 수 있게 지켜주세요!","source_cn":"艾雅保佑，请让我平安离开锈锚港吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA1C1964AED8F18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人科博":{"text":"상인 코보","source":"商人科博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}